@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# =============================================================================
# TA-provided IK/FK execution trace dataset (grading; do not modify)
#
# 30 records, good and bad mixed, including threshold-boundary values.
# Your shapes.ttl is validated against this file, and the result is compared
# record by record with ta-answer-key.json: each record's flag set must
# match the answer EXACTLY (no false positives, no false negatives).
# Boundary semantics: numeric thresholds are INCLUSIVE (sh:maxInclusive) —
# values exactly at 0.90 / 0.02 / 0.005 conform; joint limits are inclusive
# too — an angle exactly at a limit is legal.
# =============================================================================

